Browse, queue, scrub waveforms across multi-hour DJ mixes, and press your keyboard's hardware media keys inside `soundcloud.com` as normal—while your computer's internal speakers stay silent and your Hi-Fi amplifier plays single-decode `44.1 kHz / 24-bit` `0 dB` PCM audio (with live bidirectional HEOS hardware master volume & mute control right from the browser popup and player bar).

