## What's New & Highlights in `{{RELEASE_TAG}}`

- **Bidirectional Remote HEOS Hardware Master Volume & Mute (`0 dB` Digital Integrity Preserved)**:
  - Control your Denon or Marantz HEOS amplifier's physical analog preamplifier attenuator (`0–100%` slider, `−`/`+` 2% steps, and mute toggle) directly from **both** the SoundClud Extension Popup and the SoundCloud bottom player-bar Cast Pill, with instant live push sync whenever you turn the physical amplifier knob or use your IR remote—while keeping digital PCM audio locked at `0 dBFS` unity gain.
- **Marantz / Denon Front OLED & Elapsed-Time Progress Fix**:
  - Eliminated periodic `"Sleep ▶ Off"` OSD popups on Marantz PM7000N / HEOS front displays by replacing intrusive `SLPOFF` commands with mutex-serialized read-only Host-MCU status heartbeats (`PW?` / `SI?`), and restored continuous 1 Hz elapsed-time ticks by switching HEOS CLI keepalives to read-only `system/heart_beat` + `get_play_state` with adaptive `1000 ms` steady-state UPnP polling.
- **Performance, Memory & Reliability Overhaul**:
  - Reduced HLS segment RAM cache footprint by **75%** (`96` -> `24` segments), extracted shared DLNA/PCM byte-range planning (`stream_planner`), added mDNS receiver IP failover across DHCP renewals, serialized single-socket Host-MCU `:23` access, and expanded offline verification to **314 automated Vitest/E2E tests** + full Rust adversarial suites.
- **Automatic SoundCloud Go+ High Quality (`256 kbps` AAC-LC @ `44.1 kHz`)**: Uses your existing `soundcloud.com` browser session with **zero separate login** and **zero disk-stored credentials**, automatically upgrading SoundCloud Web's default `sq` stream to `hq` (`aac_256k`) when available—including private and secret-link tracks.
- **Single-Decode `24-bit / 44.1 kHz` `0 dB` PCM Transport (Direct HEOS & Optical TOSLINK)**:
  - **Direct Denon & Marantz HEOS Network Streaming**: Decodes SoundCloud's stream once to `24-bit / 44.1 kHz` `0 dB` PCM and wraps raw samples verbatim inside uncompressed RFC 9639 `SUBFRAME_VERBATIM` FLAC (`CRC-8`/`CRC-16` verified, zero lossy re-compression, zero `48 kHz` OS mixer resampling) with `STREAMINFO`, `SEEKTABLE`, and `VORBIS_COMMENT` tags for live **Track Title**, **Artist**, and **Elapsed / Total Time** on the amplifier's OLED.
  - **Bit-Perfect Optical TOSLINK Mode (`44.1 kHz` S/PDIF)**: Locks macOS CoreAudio physical sample rate to `44,100 Hz` at `0 dB` unity gain with continuous silent S/PDIF optical clock lock (`anullsrc`) to eliminate DAC relock clicks between tracks.
- **Multi-Hour DJ Mix Resilience & Graceful Widevine Fallback**: Transparently refreshes expiring SoundCloud HLS CDN signatures mid-mix (`HTTP 403` recovery), supports instant `HTTP 206` byte-range waveform seeking across 1–4+ hour sets, and plays single Widevine-DRM tracks locally while automatically resuming Hi-Fi handoff on the next track.

